    "blogtextliquid_LBJgtB": {
      "type": "editorial--blog-text-liquid",
      "custom_css": [],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>There is a question that comes up constantly when people are discovering Scentspired for the first time: does an inspired perfume actually match the designer original? It is a fair question. The internet is flooded with cheap dupes that smell synthetic, screechy, or vanish thirty minutes after spraying.</p><p>To answer it once and for all, we conducted a rigorous double-blind wear test. We put our bestsellers side by side against the iconic $200-$400 designer bottles they are inspired by, testing opening accuracy, drydown nuance, projection, and longevity on real skin.</p>"
      }
    },
